OL,3,GNEWSAMan injured in fall from hospital
OL,4,Awindow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been seriously injured in a
OL,7,Ffall from a second-floor window at York
OL,8,FHospital, police have said.
OL,10,FIt happened at about 17:35 BST on
OL,11,FSaturday and the man received treatment
OL,12,Fat the hospital following the fall,
OL,13,Faccording to North Yorkshire Police.
OL,15,FA force spokesperson said officers were
OL,16,Fpresent at the hospital at the time of
OL,17,Fthe incident and there had been
OL,18,Fprevious police contact with the man.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
