OL,3,GNEWSAMan injured in fall from hospital
OL,4,Awindow
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result, a mandatory referral had
OL,7,Fbeen made by North Yorkshire Police to
OL,8,Fthe Independent Office for Police
OL,9,FConduct and a full investigation to
OL,10,Festablish the circumstances prior to
OL,11,Fthe fall was under way, the
OL,12,Fspokesperson added.
